{
  "slug": "blood-and-shadow",
  "features": [
    {
      "id": 365,
      "name": "Reel Area & Ritual Bar",
      "description": "The reel setup is 4-4-4-4-4 rows across 5 reels with a Ritual bar at the bottom row.\nWinning combinations will be destroyed and remaining symbols will tumble down, allowing the new symbols to fall in.\nAt the Ritual Bar, there are 5 levels of progression. The Ritual Bar resets for each level-up. Exceeding collects are carried over to the next level.\n- Level 1: 20 - Level 2: 30 - Level 3: 40 - Level 4: 60 - Level 5: 80\nLanding the Scatter Symbols and winning combinations of medium and high paying symbols advances the Ritual Bar.\n- Medium paying symbol = +1 per winning symbol - High paying symbol = +2 per winning symbol\n- Scatter Symbol = +10 per Scatter symbol\nEach level removes the lowest paying symbol and also converts medium symbols to high paying symbols.",
      "disclaimer": null,
