    {
      "id": 366,
      "name": "Candle Spins",
      "description": "Reaching a new level of the Ritual Bar awards +2 Candle Spins till level 4.\n+6 Freespins are awarded when advancing to Cursed Spins.\nBefore any new level, any plausible wins pays out before progressing to the next level. During Candle Spins, the Ritual bar performs the same as in the base game.",
